        "title": "Making Requests with CAN",
        "conceptId": "intro",
        "content": "You learned that 'Can' is used for Ability and Permission.\n\nNow let's use it for REQUESTS (Asking someone to do something for you).\n\nExample:\n'Can you help me?'",
        "example": "It's casual and friendly. Let's see some real-life examples."
      }
    },
